<h1 id=3D"UserManagementAmendments-UserAccountStateTransitions">User Accoun=
t State Transitions</h1>
<h2 id=3D"UserManagementAmendments-ExternalIdP">External IdP</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Original</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Amendment</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <h3 id=3D"UserManagementAmendments-Off-boarding">Off-boarding</h3>
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
 confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" alt=3D"image-2024-3-27_1=
5-2-36.png" height=3D"150" src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/=
1678277031/image-2024-3-27_15-2-36.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1=
711566156677&amp;api=3Dv2" data-image-src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/a=
ttachments/1678277031/image-2024-3-27_15-2-36.png?version=3D1&amp;modificat=
ionDate=3D1711566156677&amp;api=3Dv2"></span></p>
      <ul>
       <li>Based on inactivity=20
        <ul>
         <li>There will be a time-based profile deletion for users with no =
activity</li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
       <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
        <ul>
         <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
          <ul>
           <li>After an initial period of inactivity (initial_inactivity_da=
ys in FUM firm configuration) the user profile on NBC Okta will be deleted.=
<br>
             If the user logs in after this period, the NBC Okta profile wi=
ll get auto-created again.</li>
           <li>After an extended period of inactivity, (where the user prof=
ile on External IDP is deleted) Compass will suspend the profile.</li>
           <li>After an NBC default period of not being re-instated, the us=
er profile will be deleted in Compass.</li>
          </ul></li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul>
      <p>Ref.&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NA/External+IDP+S=
SO#ExternalIDPSSO-c.Off-boarding" rel=3D"nofollow">External IDP SSO - NBIN =
Architecture - Confluence (bnc.ca)</a></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks" style=3D"color:#09326c;">=
<img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"200" style=3D"width:200px;max-=
width: 100%;" src=3D"2ad75646be54d290edcb3f15ef7739daf64aca5980ad0d2c8efa63=
9a7c772c0b" height=3D"174"></span></p>
      <ol>
       <li><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks" style=3D"color:#09326c;=
">The transition from&nbsp;<em>active</em> to <em>suspended</em> state dire=
ctly (<span style=3D"color:#cd519d;">purple arrow</span>) is not limited to=
 the use case of a user leaving a firm.</span></li>
       <li><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks" style=3D"color:#09326c;=
">X period: is <strong><u>not</u> firm specific</strong> (i.e. not a Produc=
t requirement) but rather a NBC CIAM requirement. The value is configurable=
 but must be set by CIAM, <strong>e.g.</strong> 90 days =3D&gt; Identity (O=
kta) Profile gets <em>deleted</em></span></li>
       <li><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks" style=3D"color:#09326c;=
">Y period: is <strong>firm specific</strong> but could have a default Prod=
uct value, <strong>e.g.</strong> X + 90 days =3D&gt; Access (CX) Profile ge=
ts <em>suspended</em></span></li>
       <li>Z period: is <strong>firm specific</strong>, <strong>e.g.</stron=
g> Y + 60 days =3D&gt; Access (CX) Profile gets <em>decommissioned</em></li=
>
      </ol>
      <p><strong>N.B.</strong></p>
      <ul>
       <li>Although the attestation team has a process for reviewing regula=
rly (i.e. every month or so) the list of user accounts with every firm, the=
 <em>time-based profile deletion for inactivity</em> is a CIAM security pri=
nciple that must remain and be applied. That being said, it can be set for =
a longer period than the attestation process (e.g. 2-3 cycles).</li>
      </ul>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"UserManagementAmendments-InternalIdP">Internal IdP</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Original</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Amendment</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <h3 id=3D"UserManagementAmendments-StateTransition">State Transition<=
/h3>
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"431" src=3D"2e40fdd301a0f5db70d9d745e2e5fc3=
3a2cb6fab1e96b8880c8f2ec177056623" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/=
1993200321/image-2024-9-19_15-0-49.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1=
726772449776&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-=
resource-id=3D"1993201729" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-r=
esource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-202=
4-9-19_15-0-49.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resou=
rce-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1993200=
321" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"24" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" =
width=3D"468"></span><br>
        Ref. <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NA/User+Management#User=
Management-StateTransition" rel=3D"nofollow">User Management - NBIN Archite=
cture - Confluence (bnc.ca)</a></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"200" style=3D"width:2=
00px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"220b72268296fe7c3983e43ac4fedd1fd246f09f9ae35=
135b9bd5221d7e2bba6" height=3D"184"></p>
      <p>As requested by the product team:</p>
      <ul>
       <li>A user account can be transitioned from any state to <em>suspend=
ed</em> and back</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Technical implications:</p>
      <ul>
       <li>Maintain a state transition history</li>
       <li>Current state database record should reference the previous stat=
e record to facilitate rollback operations</li>
      </ul>
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
